# Checklists

- Read `checklists/AI-INSTRUCTIONS.md` before editing.
- Keep checklist items aligned with canonical docs, manifests, and runbooks.
- Prefer additive checkbox items; do not remove gates without an explicit request.
- Do not invent production approvers, windows, or environment-specific values—mark them as required inputs.
- When cutover or split steps change, update related docs and migration-wave guidance together.
